# Allowlist approach: everything is ignored by default, and only the
# public, friend-facing site (docs/) plus a couple of safe project files
# are explicitly un-ignored below. This is deliberate — it means a new
# file only ever gets published if it's added to the allowlist here,
# never by accident.
#
# Original PowerPoint/PDF/Word files, the local full site (with links back
# to those originals), lesson-authoring sources, and processing scripts
# all stay on this computer and are never pushed to GitHub.

*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!docs/
!docs/**
